  "sourceDescription": "## Features\n- Pre-lit Artificial Christmas Tree\n- 8 Lighting modes\n- high-quality durable material\n- Compact 3ft size suits smaller rooms\n- Fiber optic lights change color automatically\n- Flashing or off mode allows simple control\n- Metal stand helps keep the tree upright\n- Artificial PVC design supports repeat use\n\n## Information\n𝟒𝐅𝐓 𝐆𝐑𝐄𝐄𝐍 𝐀𝐋𝐀𝐒𝐊𝐀𝐍 𝐏𝐈𝐍𝐄 𝐓𝐑𝐄𝐄: Measures 120cm high including the stand and approximately 65cm wide, with 230 tips creating a bushy artificial Christmas tree. Spread and shape the branches after assembly to prepare the green foliage for your chosen baubles, ribbons and Christmas tree decorations. 𝟏𝟏𝟎 𝐂𝐎𝐎𝐋 𝐖𝐇𝐈𝐓𝐄 𝐋𝐄𝐃𝐒 & 𝟖 𝐌𝐎𝐃𝐄𝐒: This prelit Christmas tree includes 110 cool white LEDs. Choose Combination, In Waves, Sequential, Slo-Glo, Chasing/Flash, Slow Fade, Twinkle/Flash or Steady On to switch between animated lighting effects and a constant glow for your festive indoor display. 𝐏𝐕𝐂 𝐁𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐂𝐇𝐄𝐒 & 𝐌𝐄𝐓𝐀𝐋 𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐍𝐃: Made with PVC foliage and metal construction, this Alaskan pine Christmas tree includes a metal stand to support the display. The wrapped branch construction forms the tree outline, while the green tips provide a backdrop for ornaments and the built-in cool white lights.\nBring a touch of holiday spirit with this pre-lit Alaskan Pine Cool White LEDs tree, perfect for creating a warm and festive atmosphere in your home.",
